{title: 301 - Near, Still Nearer}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #301 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Db}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 301}
{meta: category Gospel - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Db]Nearer, still [Ab]nearer, [Bbm]close [Gb]to Thy [Db]heart,
[Gb]Draw me, my [Db]Savior, so [Bbm]pre[Eb]cious [Eb7]Thou [Ab]art;
[Db]Fold me, O [Ab]fold [Db]me [Gb]close [Ab7]to[Db]Thy [Ab]breast,
[Db]Shel[Gb]ter me [Db]safe in that [Ab]haven of [Db]rest,
[Gb]Shelter me [Db]safe [Cm]in that [Db]ha[Ab7]ven of [Db]rest.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Db]Nearer, [Ab]still [Bbm]nearer, [Gb]nothing [Db]I bring,
[Gb]Nought [Db]as [Bbm]an offering [Eb]to [Eb7]Jesus [Ab]my King-
[Db][Ab]Only [Db]my [Gb]sinful [Ab7]now [Db]contrite [Ab]heart,
[Db]Grant [Gb]me the [Db]cleansing [Ab]Thy blood [Db]doth impart,
[Gb]Grant [Db]me [Cm]the cleansing [Db]Thy [Ab7]blood [Db]doth impart.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Db]Nearer, [Ab]still [Bbm]nearer, Lord, [Gb]to [Db]be Thine;
[Gb]Sin, [Db]with [Bbm]its [Eb]follies, [Eb7]I [Ab]gladly resign,
[Db]All [Ab]of [Db]its [Gb]pleasures, [Ab7]pomp [Db]and [Ab]its pride;
[Db]Give [Gb]me [Db]but Jesus, [Ab]my [Db]Lord crucified,
[Gb]Give [Db]me [Cm]but [Db]Jesus, [Ab7]my [Db]Lord crucified.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Db]Nearer, [Ab]still [Bbm]nearer, while [Gb]life [Db]shall last;
[Gb]Till [Db]safe [Bbm]in glory [Eb]my [Eb7]anchor [Ab]is cast;
[Db][Ab]Through [Db]endless [Gb]ages, [Ab7]ever [Db]to [Ab]be,
[Db]Nearer, [Gb]my [Db]Savior, still [Ab]nearer [Db]to Thee,
[Gb]Nearer, [Db]my [Cm]Savior, [Db]still [Ab7]nearer [Db]to Thee.
{end_of_verse}
